sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Author
    participant FE as Web client
    participant API as REST API
    participant AGG as Aggregation module
    participant YT as YouTube Data API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    actor M as Moderator
    A->>FE: Paste playlist URL
    FE->>API: POST /api/submissions {url}
    API->>AGG: importPlaylist(id)
    AGG->>YT: playlists.list (1 unit)
    AGG->>YT: playlistItems.list (1 unit / 50 items)
    AGG->>YT: videos.list (durations, 1 unit / 50 ids)
    YT-->>AGG: metadata
    AGG->>DB: save title (PENDING), seasons, episodes
    API-->>FE: 201 Created
    M->>FE: Open moderation queue
    FE->>API: POST /api/submissions/{id}/approve
    API->>DB: moderation_status = PUBLISHED
